  "description": {
   "en": "The cute little girl's request is absolute. Even if it means death!!\nThe family composed of the father, a detective, middle schooler Sakura Mana, three-year-old Reina, and her grandmother move into a new town. Every day since they moved, Reina dreams of a crowd piercing both of her eyes. Reina is at the age of cuteness, and when she makes a request with those big, round eyes, no one can resist.\n　However, one after another, those who follow Reina's orders suffer tragic fates...\n\n• Devil Girl Reborn: The Angel from Darkness (魔少女転生 闇からきた天使)\n• Devil Girl Reborn: New Birth (魔少女転生 新たなる誕生)\n• Devil Girl Reborn: Dominantion (魔少女転生 支配)\n• Devil Girl's Toy Box (魔少女のおもちゃ箱)\n• Our Lady of Sorrows (嘆きの聖母)\n• Dirty White Coat (汚れた白衣)\n• The First Year of Neglects... (怠慢元年)\n• My Fear no.1 (私の恐怖NO.1)\n\n\nThe second part of the collection of horror masterpieces about girls in panic!! (Referring to the original Mashoujo Tensei)\n\nVolume 1 of Yoshimi Seki Kessakushuu\n\n1: Mashoujo Tensei\n2: Shiiku Byoutou\n3: MAD HOUSE\n4: MAD PAPA\n5: Kusatta Ringo ga Kudatte Kuru\n6: Zetsubou e no Countdown\n7: Yokubou no Honoo - Gaman Dekinai\n8: Sajou no Bunmei\n9: Fukoufuku no Ouji\n10: Seigi no Hakonune\n11: Shi ni Takunai\n12 Norowareta Yuuenchi"
  },
